<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- LYN60 USFM</book>
  <para style="h">Jakobo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Jakobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo okutunda kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JAKOBO</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka ya Jakobo kame ina kun̄oliwa ku munjili oisaniwa Jakobo. Esi kame sitwesahala nji wuyu neli Jakobo minaye Jesu, woyo neli omwendisi mu Keleke na kunyima mi neli ekalulo no kuta ya Jelusalema (Tikezo 15.13). Omutumiwa Paulusi naku mwisananga nji ‘Omusumo’ no Keleke mu Magalaata 2.9. Asiku kwiyeta kame alumela nji ebuka ya Jakobo kame ina kun̄oliwa mu myaka makumi atanu (50) munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite. Kakuli Jakobo neli omwendisi no keleke mu Jelusalema, mwendi kame ana kun̄ola ebuka eyi yoli mu Jelusalema.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jakobo kame an̄ola ebuka yaye ku masika no kukwana “likumi ni twili (12) awo anahasanele mu naha” (1.1) etuto mu buka ya Jakobo, kame ifanena oukutusisa yo kwa sikupumena onje kono omukwa no oukutusisa amaywi “likumi ni twili (12)” Kame sikumonisa nji Jakobo kame ana kun̄ola mukuyuleka kwa sikupumena no Majuda. Kakuli ebuka eyi kame ina kun̄oliwa nji ikeele mu maoko no sikwata sinene sawo asikubala, kame inakwamba ba tituto no kupula. Jokobo yonyene kame ana kutwalela onene omunahano ba ulikani mukaci no tumelo ni tikezo. Etumelo no niti mbaimonahala ni tikezo (2.17). Kame anaabi emamela mulibaka no kumonisa eketululo kwaanu asikufuma (2.1-4) mi kame atwambela nji tumamele neyo twaamba (3.1-12).</para>
  <para style="iot">EMITWI NO YAAMBO</para>
  <para style="io">1. Jakobo kame akeeta asikubala aye. (1.1)</para>
  <para style="io">2. Esisitatamako kame asusuweza asikupumena koongota aba ayanda (1.2-27)</para>
  <para style="io">3. Cwale kame atwambela omo kutwesahalela etumelo okumonahaza mu tikezo (1.1-26)</para>
  <para style="io">4. Munyima no eyi kame aamba amaata no maywi (3.1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Cwale Jakobo kame atoloka omo kushutanena okushangama kwa Nyambe ni kushangama no litunga (3.13-4;10).</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Esisistatamako kame alemusa asikubala mulibaka no kukununeka (4.11-5;6).</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Jakobo kame amana ebuka yaye mu 5.7-20 mu kuba etitaelo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa Jakobo, omubika wa Nyambe ni wa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Kame ni n̄olela amasika likumi na yiili aa ana hasana mene nji, shaangwe.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etumelo ni ku Shangama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Abaange, mu wabelelwe aba mwiyelwa amayando no kupula, <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>kakuli mulimuke nji okwetekiwa mu tumelo yenu kame ku militela okongola. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Cwale mulesele oukoongota kwenu kumanenene omusebezi kwako no kwiyala, nji mutende aa no kupetahala ni kukula, me mwasaela esinjili. <verse eid="JAS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Nji omunjili mwaanyi kakwite oku shangama, akumbele kwa Nyambe woyo obaanga aanu ni mucima mumweya youlwile okusaisisa omubonda, mi mba biwi. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Kono akumbele mu tumelo, yo ulwile okwasepa, kakuli woyo no kwasepa kame akufekile kanyi mandinda naba liwate awo akashetwa oku noku ku mebo. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Omunu no mukwa no ngeso, alese kutatelela nji mbatambula esinjili okutunda kwa Mbumu. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Omunu no ngeso ni wa micima yiili kame akukana mwinu atenda yonje.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okusheba ni Kufuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Mulesele woyo no kusheba akukumuse mu kununekiwa kwaye kwa Nyambe, <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>mi osikufuma akukumuse mu ukukokobeza kwaye kwa Nyambe, kakuli kanyi epalisa no mopu aba saukukute. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Kakuli eliywaa aba lipa ni kubya kwalyo kame liletukisa omoopu, etipalisa tawo kame tikwa ni kuwaba kwayo kame isinyeha. Mu mukwa no ngeso omufumi ni yonyene mba sinyehe ngeso yo sipatehile ni yaye.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emiliko ni Kwetekiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Embuyoti ni ya woyo omunu okongota mu mayando, kakuli aba akoma aba aetekiwa , mba tambula omushukwe no moyo eyo Nyambe na ku sepisa kwaanu awo amu singa. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Omunu alese okwamba aba aetekiwa nji, “Nyambe kame aneteka.” Kakuli Nyambe kaetekiwa ni uyii mane ni yonyene kaeteke omunu. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Kono omunu yonje kame aetekiwa aba akokiwa ni ku putelelwa ku titakazo taye no kwiiba. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Cwale etakazo aba ikula kame ileya esibi, mi esibi aba sikula kame silita olufu.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Abaange aa asingwa, mulese okongiwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Oku petahala no kuwaba ni mpo yonje no kuwaba kame itunda ku wilu, okwiiya banji okuunda kwa Sitoo no masebeli, woyo no kwa futuka, kanyi omwiinda aba ufutuka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Mu ku singa kwaye, na tuleye ni liywi no niti nji ku yumbiwa yaye tutende embuya no weeli.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyupa ni Kutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Abaange aa asingiwa! mu limuke eyi, omunu yonje atende woyo oyupa mu wangu, kono akatabe mu kwamba, woyo no kwatina wangu. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Kakuli okutweba kwa munu ka ku sebeze okuluka kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Cwalehe mulesele eyo yonje no kwiiba neyo isiliko no lunya mi mutambule ni musa eliywi elyo likuniwa mwaanyi, elyo litwesa okuyoyisa emyoyo yenu.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Kono mutende atendi no liywi, kasa aa ayupa feela, kame mukoonga mwenyene. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Cwale nji omunu ni muteeteti no liywi mi katende, kame akufekile kanyi omunu oku mona olubala lwaye ana kuleiwa nalo mu siponi. <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>Cwalehe aba amana oku mona wino yonyene mi nuukutela, mba pulama wangu omo aikalele. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Kono woyo waliketa mu mulawo no ku petahala, wonyene omulawo no tukuluho, mi ni koongotetetamo, kasa osi kuyupa feela niku pulama, kono osi kutenda omusebezi, mba fuyolwa mu misebezi yaye.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Nji omunu kame ayambuta nji kame atenda wino omusebezi wa Nyambe, mi kakuleme olulimi lwaye, kono kame akoonga mu omucima waye, woyo omunu okupumena kwaye ni kwambulwa tuso. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Okutenda wino omusebezi wa Nyambe no kukena ni niti no kwa nyazahala balubala lwa Nyambe ni Sitetu neesi, oku lekula andiyala ni timbela mu matata oo, mi yo kubabalela kweeyi no litunga yo ulwile eso anyazahala naso.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Etemuso okulwisa Esaluluti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Abaange, mulese okumonisa esaluluti aba mulema etumelo ya Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite, Ombumu no kanya. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Kakuli nji omunu oli ni lisale no gauda ku munwe mi kame akufukile eyi no kuwaba yoiya mu mukopano wenu, mi ni woyo no kusheba yoku fukile mu ikumango no kukaoka ni yonyene kame sebeli oiya. <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Nji kame mutwala etingana kwa woyo okufukile eikumango no kuwaba ni ku mwambela nji, “Wiiye wikale bano aba no kuwaba,” kono kwa woyo no kusheba kame mu mwambela nji, “Wimane abo, simba nji, “Wikale banji ku makondo ange,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>cwale abo kame mumonisa esaluluti mukaci kenu, cwale kame mwatula ni minahano no kwiiba. <verse eid="JAS 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Abaange aa asingiwa, muteetete! Kandi Nyambe kasiketa aa ashebile mu litunga nji afume mu tumelo ni ku yoola omubuso ana ku sepisa kwawo amu singa? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Kono anyi kamusi kuteka aasi kusheeba! Kasa okame awo asikufuma awo amiyandisa, kasa okame awo amitwala ku kuta oka mizekisa? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Kandi kasa okame awo anyefula elitina elyo no ku kutekeha elyo mwiisaniwa na lyo?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Nji kame mwiiyateteta omulao no mubuso, okukumanena nomu ung'olelwe mu mang'olo nji, “Osinge mwabowe kanyi omo oku singila wenyene” abohe kame mutenda wino. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Kono aba mu monisa esaluluti kame mu tenda esibi, mi abo kame muwaniwa ni mubonda ku mulawo, kanyi woyo ona colo omulao. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Kakuli woyo yonje oteula omulao onje kono kame acolabo mumweya, abo nacola emilao yonje. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Kakuli woyo wamba nji, “Olese kubuka,” ni kwamba kame nji, “Olese kwibaa.” Nji kubuku, kono kame wibaa, nu colo omulao. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Abo cwale mwaambe mi mu tende kanyi awo sa atuliwe munji no mulawo no tukuluho. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Kakuli ekatulo kaikwite amakeke kwa woyo nokwamonisa amakeke, kono amakeke kame akoma ekatulo.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etumelo ni Tikezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Abaange, sibine esi sili ni tuso nji omunu kame aamba nji, kame ali ni tumelo kono kakwite emisebezi? kana etumelo yaye kame itwesa oku muyoyisa? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Cwale nji omwabowe no mulume ni mwabowe no mukati kame aulwile esikumango nesi no kulya, <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>cwale omunjili mwaanyi aambele nji, “Mweende mu kozo! Muka enyenwe ni kulya wino!” mi kamwaabi eyo isaeliwa ku tinyutu too, Iikene cwale itusa abo? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Cwale etumelo yonyene feela nji kaikwite omusebezi, ya kufa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Kono omunjili kame saambe nji, “Wene kame oli ni tumelo, meene kame nili ni misebezi.” Oni monise etumelo yowe oku nambulwa emisebezi, mi meene mba niku monisa etumelo yange mulibaka no misebezi yange. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Wene opumena nji Nyambe ni mumweya kame utenda wino, Simba emebo no kwiiba kame ipumena ngeso, ni kucila. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Wene omweelo, kame osinga nji nikumonise emisebezi? etumelo nambulwa emisebezi ya kufa. <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Kasa nji Sitetu Abulahama nakutendiwa osi kuluka mulibaka no misebezi yaye, aba ana kusinga okutenda Mwanaye Isaka esitabelo ba aletale? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Kame omona nji etumelo naiku sebelisana bamweya ni misebezi yaye, mi etumelo yaye kame iiyatetetwa mulibaka no misebezi. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Mane amang'olo na iyatetetwe awo aamba nji, “Abulahama kame apumena kwa Nyambe, mi na kwibalelwa nji kuluka.” mi kame ana kwisaniwa nji mulikani wa Nyambe. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Kame mu mona nji omunu kame atendiwa ona kuluka mu misebezi yaye kasa mulibaka no tumelo yomboci feela.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Mundila imweya Lahaba olihule, na ku beekiwa woyo no luka mulibaka no misebezi yaye aba ana ku tambula amatwela awo ana ku tumiwa mi sebeli wausa ni ndila indina. <verse eid="JAS 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Kakuli olutu aba lukutaba ni mebo lwakufa, mane ni tumelo nambulwa emisebezi ya kufa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Olulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Abaange, mulese okutenda aiyeti no kupula kakuli kame muyii nji aaci twiyeta kame satu atuliwe ni katulo no kuneneba mu utata. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Kakuli tonje kame tu tendanga etifoso no kupula. Cwale nji mumweya kwanyi kafoso mweyo aamba, woyo munu waku petahala, kame atwese oukulema kweyi no lutu lwaye lonje ngeso. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Nji tu beeke olumingo mu tunwa no timbii nji titu yupele, kame tu twesa okwendisa etinyutu tato tonge. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Kamumone eisepe ni yonyene, simba nji ya kuneneba mi kame yendisiwa ku mebo inene, kame yendisiwa ku kaondo kanyonyo kame ita oko asinga omwendisi wayo konje. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Mundila imweya olulimi nisilama nokucaniba ba lutu kono kame lununeka ba inu no kuneneba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Komunahane omushitu omo unenebele kono kame ocin̄iwa olubya ku mulilo no kucaniba. <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Cwale olulimi kame lukufekile ni mulilo. Olulimi kame lutendile elitunga no kwakena mukaci no ilama yetu, kame lusilafaza olutu longe, mi kame luyakisite omulilo omwendelo no moyo, ni lonyene olulimi na luyakisiwa omulilo no lyangalilo. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Kakuli omifuta yonje no ibatana ni iyunyi neyo yeenda ni mapumo, ni yumbiwa na mu liwate, kame itwesa oku leliwa, mi nai leliwa kwaanu. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Kono omunu katwese oku babalela olulimi, ouyi no kwa tikelwa, olu lwiyalile omulyashinji no kwibaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Mwa lonyene olulimi kame tuyeema Mbumu Nyambe ni Sitetu, mi mwa lonyene kame tukuta aanu, awo ana umbiwa mu sifekiso sa Nyambe. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Mu kanwa kamweya ako kame ku tunda embuyoti ni ikuto. Abaange kakufanene nji ku tendahale ngeso. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Kana mu lisima limweya kame ku fanena oku tunda ameyi no kumamata ni meyi no kulula ba nako imweya? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Abaange, kana esitondo no mukuyu kame sitwesa okubeeka embuya no olibe, simba estondo no beine sibeeke mukuyu? Kakwisa ameyi no mungwa atwesa okulita okumamata.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okushangama kutunda Kuwilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Anyine no kushangama ni ku yupisisa mukaci kenu? Mu moyo waye no kuwaba amonise emisebezi yaye itendiwa mu uku kokobeza no kushangama. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Kono nji kame mukwite omuna no ku lula, ni ulyangelino mu micilma yenu, mulesele oukununeka simba okukana eniti. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Oku shangama no ngeso ka ku tundu ku wilu, kono ni kwa litunga, no kwakena ni dimona. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Kakuli abo kuli omuna ni ulyangelino, kakwisa ekozo mane nikwayupa ni mifili-fili. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Kono okushangama oko kutunda ku wilu kwa kukena konje baweli, kame kuli ni kozo, ni likute, ni kutompeha, mi kwakwiyala esishemo ni mbuya no kuwaba, nambulwa esishweka simba okwasepahala. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Cwale ekutulo no kuluka kame ikuniwa mu kozo kwaanu awo ayoyisana mu kozo.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Esilikani ni Litunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Iikene eyo ilita etindwaa ni mifili-fili mukaci kenu? Kasanji mu titakazo no ilama yenu mo kutunda etindwaa? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Kame mu singa kono ka mukwite cwale kame mwibaa. Mi kame mushukela kono kamukwite, kame mufapana, ni kulwaa. Ka mu wana eso mu saela kakuli ka mu kumbele. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Kame mu kumbela kono ka mu tambula eso mu kumbela, kakuli kame mukumbelanga omo no kwa fanena, nji mwitendise okuta mu titakazo tenu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Aanyi eyumbiwa no kwasepahala! ka mu limukile nji oulikani ni litunga kame utendile esiila kwa Nyambe? Abakulingeso woyo osinga oku tenda woyo no litunga kame akutenda yonyene esiila sa Nyambe. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Simba kame mu nahana nji eyi yambiwa mu mang'olo niya mbulwa tuso aba kwamba nji, “Nyambe kame anyolelwe mu lifuba mulibaka no mebo eyo ana beeke mwaaci” <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Kono Nyambe kame atwekeleza esishemo. Cwalehe kame kwambiwa nji, “Nyambe kame akanena awo aku kumusa, kono kame aba esishemo kwaawo aku kokobeza.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Cwalehe mu kubeeke kwa Nyambe. Mu kanene Odiyabulosi, mi mbacili kwaanyi. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Mu sheetete kwa Nyambe mi ni yonyene mba sheetete kwaanyi. Mu yowise amaoko enu, anyi asikutenda esibi, mi mu kenise emicima yenu, anyi asi micima yiili! <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Mweene, ni ku lila niku bokolola. Okusheka kwenu ku futuke esililo, oku wabelelwa kwenu ku futuke okweena. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Mu ku kokobeze balubala lwa Nyambe, mi mba mikulisa.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etemuso no Kwatula Omukowe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Abaange, mulese okwamba esi no kwiiba ku munjili ni munjli. Woyo wamba eyi no kwiiba ku mwabaye, simba okwatula omwabaye, kame aamba eyi no kwiiba ku mulawo ni kwatula omulao. Cwale nji kame watula omulawo, kutendile osi mulao kono osi kwatula omulao. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Kwaali osi kuba emilawo ni kwatula, woyo otwesa oku tuyoyisa ni ku sinya. Cwale tiwe anyine nji watule akowe?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etemuso mu Ukununeka eyi no Byuunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Mwiiye cwale, anyi mwambanga nji, “Balelo simba byuunda kame satute mu tolopo injili tuka ikalemo omwaka nuuka ulisetamo tu kawane amali no kupula.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Kandi ka mulimukile eyi na byuunda! Omoyo wenu ubine? Kakuli kame muku fekile kanyi embundu eyi imonahala mu nako icana feela, mi cwale ni kubwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Kame mufanena okwamba nji, “Ombumu nji osinge, nji tusiyoya, kame satu tende esi simba siya.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Kanyi omu kwikalele, kame muku nuneka mu ku bambaba kwenu. Oukununeka oko konje ni kwa kwiiba.<verse eid="JAS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Cwale woyo yonje olimuka oku tenda ouwa mi kautende, kame atenda esibi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Etemuso ku Mufumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Cwale anyi muluwile, mu lile ni ku bokolola ku mayando awo asa miiyele! <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Oufumu wenu na woolo ni ikumango yenu na iliwi ku utwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Egauda ni silibela yenu ili ni mafumi, mi amafumi yayo ni upaki owo umilema mi mba ili etinyutu tenu kanyi mulilo. Na mu ungeka oufumu no maywaa no mamaneneno. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Komumone! kamwa siteneka amali kwawo ana sebeze mu matema enu awo munali mu umbuyi, kame alila, mi okulila koo awo asi kuyangula na ku kakeela mu matwi a Mbumu no timpi. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Na mu yoyo mu litunga mu ukukola eminyaka, na mu nunisa emicima yenu mu liywaa no kwibaa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Na mukana ni kwibaa woyo no kuluka, mi kasi mikana.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okutatelela ni Tapelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Abaange, mutatelele cwale, okutwala abo sa kaiyele Mbumu. Komumone! Omulimi kame atatelela ombuya no utokwa no litunga, mi kame atatelela oku twala abo saka tambwele ombula no maseulo neyo no mamaneneno. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Naanyi mu tatelele ngeeso, mi mu koongote mu micima yenu. Kakuli okwiiya kwa Mbumu sebeli kuli beebi.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Abaange, mulese oku bilaela omunjili ku munjili, nji cwale mulese okwatuliwa, komumone! omwatuli kame aimanine ba myeelo. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Abaange, kamu londe omwanda, outata nuukongota nwa nuhi a Nyambe awo ana kwamba mu litina lya Mbumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Komumone, kame twiisana awo awabelelwa, awo ana kukoongota, na muyupu eyi ya Jobo omo ana kukoongoteta, mi na mumono okusinga kwa Mbumu ku mamaneneno, omo Ombumu ana kwiiyalela mane ni makeke.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Abaange, kono mu inu yonje, mulese okweeta, simba eyi no liwilu, simba eyi no litunga, simba mu mweetelo onje, kono Ee yenu itende Ee, mi Kokulwa yenu itende Kokulwa, nji mulese oku kwela munji no katulo.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Kana mukaci kenu kwaali woyo oyanda? A lapele. Kana kwaali woyo owabelelwe, aimbe etindimo no milumbeko. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Kana kwaali mukaci kenu woyo otomine? Aisane akulu no keleke nji amulapelele ni ku muwaa amaati mu litina lya Mbumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Mi etapelo ina tendiwa mu tumelo mba iyoyisa osikutoma, mi Mbumu mba mwingula mane nji na tende eiibi, mba ilemenwe. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Cwalehe mu kwaambe eiibi yenu omunjili ku munjli, mi muku lapelele, nji cwale mubale. Etapelo no munu no kuluka kame ikwite amaata onene mane kame itusa onene. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Eliya neli omunu ona kukufeka kanyi aci mu unu. Seli oongoteteta okulapela ni ku kumbela nji ombula alese kuloka mu litunga ba myaka yaatu ni tikweti titanu ni kamweya. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Cwale sebeli olapela kame mi eliwilu sebeli lilokisa ombula, mi elitunga sebeli lilita embuya kame.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Abaange, nji omunjili mwaanyi kame ayaukile mu niti, mi omukwaye sebeli omuusa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>woyo alimuke nji, woyo ousa osiku tenda eiibi okutunda ku uyi waye, kame ayoyisa omoyo waye ku lifu, mi na fuku eiibi no kupula.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
